{"id": "ginkgo-e4-001", "scope": "lark_chat", "language": "zh", "turns": [{"turn_id": 1, "role": "investment_manager", "text": "@合规 王志远（CST-00012345）的 KYC 资料齐了吗？他这周要打 USD 200,000 出去。", "entities": [{"text": "王志远", "canonical": "PERSON"}, {"text": "CST-00012345", "canonical": "BUSINESS_ID"}]}, {"turn_id": 2, "role": "compliance", "text": "身份证已收，住址证明缺。能不能让王志远再传一份水电单？", "entities": [{"text": "王志远", "canonical": "PERSON"}]}, {"turn_id": 3, "role": "investment_manager", "text": "好。客户号 CST-00012345 我先冻结对外汇款。", "entities": [{"text": "CST-00012345", "canonical": "BUSINESS_ID"}]}, {"turn_id": 4, "role": "compliance", "text": "另外 CST-00012345 关联的 BlueOcean Holdings Ltd. 还没补受益人结构。", "entities": [{"text": "CST-00012345", "canonical": "BUSINESS_ID"}, {"text": "BlueOcean Holdings Ltd.", "canonical": "ORG"}]}, {"turn_id": 5, "role": "investment_manager", "text": "明白，我让王志远本周内补齐。他手机 +86 138-0013-8000 可以直接联系。", "entities": [{"text": "王志远", "canonical": "PERSON"}, {"text": "+86 138-0013-8000", "canonical": "PHONE"}]}], "cross_turn_refs": [{"text": "王志远", "canonical": "PERSON", "appears_in_turns": [1, 2, 5], "note": "PERSON 跨 3 轮，必须复用同一 ⟦PERSON_N⟧"}, {"text": "CST-00012345", "canonical": "BUSINESS_ID", "appears_in_turns": [1, 3, 4], "note": "BUSINESS_ID 跨 3 轮一致性"}]}
{"id": "ginkgo-e4-002", "scope": "lark_chat", "language": "zh", "turns": [{"turn_id": 1, "role": "ic_chair", "text": "今晚 IC 标的：腾讯(0700.HK)，加仓预算 3000 万。@李慧琳 你研究组的观点是？", "entities": [{"text": "李慧琳", "canonical": "PERSON"}], "negatives": ["0700.HK", "3000 万"]}, {"turn_id": 2, "role": "research", "text": "李慧琳：腾讯 Q1 财报亮点在游戏出海，但下游广告需求疲软。建议先加 1500 万，剩余等 Q2 数据。", "entities": [{"text": "李慧琳", "canonical": "PERSON"}], "negatives": ["Q1", "Q2", "1500 万"]}, {"turn_id": 3, "role": "ic_chair", "text": "OK。Patrick 黄你那边 NVDA 仓位呢？", "entities": [{"text": "Patrick 黄", "canonical": "PERSON"}], "negatives": ["NVDA"]}, {"turn_id": 4, "role": "trader", "text": "Patrick 黄：已减 30%。当前组合 NVDA 权重 8.2%。建议落地标记合同号 HT-2026-0520-014。", "entities": [{"text": "Patrick 黄", "canonical": "PERSON"}, {"text": "HT-2026-0520-014", "canonical": "BUSINESS_ID"}], "negatives": ["30%", "NVDA", "8.2%"]}, {"turn_id": 5, "role": "ic_chair", "text": "确认。李慧琳出加仓纪要，Patrick 黄出减仓回单。", "entities": [{"text": "李慧琳", "canonical": "PERSON"}, {"text": "Patrick 黄", "canonical": "PERSON"}]}], "cross_turn_refs": [{"text": "李慧琳", "canonical": "PERSON", "appears_in_turns": [1, 2, 5], "note": "PERSON_A 复用"}, {"text": "Patrick 黄", "canonical": "PERSON", "appears_in_turns": [3, 4, 5], "note": "PERSON_B 复用，与 PERSON_A 不同 N"}]}
{"id": "ginkgo-e4-003", "scope": "lark_chat", "language": "mixed", "turns": [{"turn_id": 1, "role": "client_manager", "text": "@operations Sequoia Capital China LP 文档发给 Bruce Wang 了吗？他邮箱 bruce.wang@example-fo.com。", "entities": [{"text": "Sequoia Capital China", "canonical": "ORG"}, {"text": "Bruce Wang", "canonical": "PERSON"}, {"text": "bruce.wang@example-fo.com", "canonical": "EMAIL"}]}, {"turn_id": 2, "role": "operations", "text": "已发。LP 协议编号 LP-SCC-2023-A07。Bruce Wang 还问可不可以追加 1000 万。", "entities": [{"text": "LP-SCC-2023-A07", "canonical": "BUSINESS_ID"}, {"text": "Bruce Wang", "canonical": "PERSON"}], "negatives": ["1000 万"]}, {"turn_id": 3, "role": "client_manager", "text": "追加可以。让 Bruce Wang 走标准流程，先转客户号 CST-00045678 名下账户。", "entities": [{"text": "Bruce Wang", "canonical": "PERSON"}, {"text": "CST-00045678", "canonical": "BUSINESS_ID"}]}, {"turn_id": 4, "role": "operations", "text": "OK，LP-SCC-2023-A07 增持方案我同步给 Sequoia Capital China。", "entities": [{"text": "LP-SCC-2023-A07", "canonical": "BUSINESS_ID"}, {"text": "Sequoia Capital China", "canonical": "ORG"}]}, {"turn_id": 5, "role": "client_manager", "text": "记得抄 Bruce Wang 邮箱 bruce.wang@example-fo.com，他确认后我们启动 KYC 更新。", "entities": [{"text": "Bruce Wang", "canonical": "PERSON"}, {"text": "bruce.wang@example-fo.com", "canonical": "EMAIL"}]}], "cross_turn_refs": [{"text": "Bruce Wang", "canonical": "PERSON", "appears_in_turns": [1, 2, 3, 5], "note": "PERSON 跨 4 轮"}, {"text": "Sequoia Capital China", "canonical": "ORG", "appears_in_turns": [1, 4], "note": "ORG 跨轮"}, {"text": "LP-SCC-2023-A07", "canonical": "BUSINESS_ID", "appears_in_turns": [2, 4]}, {"text": "bruce.wang@example-fo.com", "canonical": "EMAIL", "appears_in_turns": [1, 5]}]}
{"id": "ginkgo-e4-004", "scope": "lark_chat", "language": "zh", "turns": [{"turn_id": 1, "role": "fx_trader", "text": "司徒博彦：今天 EUR/USD 跌到 1.082，建议把欧元仓位减一半。客户 黄启明 那边账户 DE89 3704 0044 0532 0130 00 余额还有 EUR 500K。", "entities": [{"text": "司徒博彦", "canonical": "PERSON"}, {"text": "黄启明", "canonical": "PERSON"}, {"text": "DE89 3704 0044 0532 0130 00", "canonical": "BANK_CARD"}], "negatives": ["EUR/USD", "1.082", "EUR 500K"]}, {"turn_id": 2, "role": "operations", "text": "黄启明客户号 CST-00045678 已确认。换汇 EUR 250K 划入 USD 账户 1234567890123。", "entities": [{"text": "黄启明", "canonical": "PERSON"}, {"text": "CST-00045678", "canonical": "BUSINESS_ID"}, {"text": "1234567890123", "canonical": "ACCOUNT"}], "negatives": ["EUR 250K"]}, {"turn_id": 3, "role": "fx_trader", "text": "司徒博彦：好。剩余 EUR 250K 留观察。要不要顺手把 黄启明 香港账号 808-123456-001 余额也对一下？", "entities": [{"text": "司徒博彦", "canonical": "PERSON"}, {"text": "黄启明", "canonical": "PERSON"}, {"text": "808-123456-001", "canonical": "ACCOUNT"}], "negatives": ["EUR 250K"]}, {"turn_id": 4, "role": "operations", "text": "对完了，HKD 80 万。下一步看 CST-00045678 的指令。", "entities": [{"text": "CST-00045678", "canonical": "BUSINESS_ID"}], "negatives": ["HKD 80 万"]}, {"turn_id": 5, "role": "fx_trader", "text": "司徒博彦：今晚发邮件给 黄启明 huang.qm@example-fo.com 通知。", "entities": [{"text": "司徒博彦", "canonical": "PERSON"}, {"text": "黄启明", "canonical": "PERSON"}, {"text": "huang.qm@example-fo.com", "canonical": "EMAIL"}]}], "cross_turn_refs": [{"text": "司徒博彦", "canonical": "PERSON", "appears_in_turns": [1, 3, 5], "note": "复姓 PERSON 跨轮"}, {"text": "黄启明", "canonical": "PERSON", "appears_in_turns": [1, 2, 3, 5], "note": "客户 PERSON 跨 4 轮"}, {"text": "CST-00045678", "canonical": "BUSINESS_ID", "appears_in_turns": [2, 4]}]}
{"id": "ginkgo-e4-005", "scope": "lark_chat", "language": "zh", "turns": [{"turn_id": 1, "role": "client", "text": "你好我是张明远，身份证 110105197508151235。想咨询基金 110011 的赎回手续。", "entities": [{"text": "张明远", "canonical": "PERSON"}, {"text": "110105197508151235", "canonical": "ID_CARD"}], "negatives": ["110011"]}, {"turn_id": 2, "role": "advisor", "text": "张先生您好。请确认下您的客户号 CST-00076543 是否正确？", "entities": [{"text": "CST-00076543", "canonical": "BUSINESS_ID"}]}, {"turn_id": 3, "role": "client", "text": "对，CST-00076543 没错。手机 13912345678 也可以收验证码。", "entities": [{"text": "CST-00076543", "canonical": "BUSINESS_ID"}, {"text": "13912345678", "canonical": "PHONE"}]}, {"turn_id": 4, "role": "advisor", "text": "OK 张明远先生。赎回款将打入您在招行尾号 6196 的卡 4485-2737-7693-6196。预计 T+2 到账。", "entities": [{"text": "张明远", "canonical": "PERSON"}, {"text": "4485-2737-7693-6196", "canonical": "BANK_CARD"}], "negatives": ["6196", "T+2"]}, {"turn_id": 5, "role": "client", "text": "好的，我手机 13912345678 收到验证码会及时回。谢谢。", "entities": [{"text": "13912345678", "canonical": "PHONE"}]}], "cross_turn_refs": [{"text": "张明远", "canonical": "PERSON", "appears_in_turns": [1, 4]}, {"text": "CST-00076543", "canonical": "BUSINESS_ID", "appears_in_turns": [2, 3]}, {"text": "13912345678", "canonical": "PHONE", "appears_in_turns": [3, 5], "note": "PHONE 跨轮"}]}
